  "sourceDocument": {
    "format": "GhostFlow/source-document-v1",
    "kind": "literate",
    "filename": "pair.ghost.md",
    "text": "# Cells\n\n<!-- ghostflow:anchor id=cell-intent kind=intent status=confirmed origin=user -->\nKeep each cell independent.\n\n```ghost\nimport Cell from \"./cell.ghost.md\" revision \"r1\" sha256 \"22a9ed3f433ae0f6ae94618c0c9a6cbdf8fea29868b743af2c266004388e53f9\";\ncontrol Pair {\n  input east_start, west_start: Bool;\n  output east_on, west_on: Bool;\n  // ghostflow:link id=cell-intent relation=implements\n  state running: Bool = false;\n  running' = east_start |> recover(false);\n  instance east: Cell;\n  instance west: Cell;\n  connect east.start <- east_start;\n  connect west.start <- west_start;\n  connect east_on <- east.on;\n  connect west_on <- west.on;\n}\n```\n",
    "sha256": "dd33ec87f4d68a49a15200897b400385e97794286b0c30eb1dd0f33daf0558ef"
  },
  "sourceClosure": {
    "format": "GhostFlow/source-closure-v1",
    "documents": [
      {
        "filename": "cell.ghost.md",
        "revision": "r1",
        "text": "# Cells\n\n<!-- ghostflow:anchor id=cell-intent kind=intent status=confirmed origin=user -->\nKeep each cell independent.\n\n```ghost\ncontrol Cell {\n  input start: Bool;\n  // ghostflow:link id=cell-intent relation=implements\n  config duration: Duration = 5s { min = 1s; max = 10s; step = 1s; access = operator; }\n  // ghostflow:link id=cell-intent relation=implements\n  state running: Bool = false;\n  // ghostflow:link id=cell-intent relation=implements\n  timer age = elapsed(running);\n  running' = running || (start |> recover(false));\n  output on: Bool;\n  on <- running' && age < (duration |> recover(0s));\n}\n```\n",
        "sha256": "22a9ed3f433ae0f6ae94618c0c9a6cbdf8fea29868b743af2c266004388e53f9"
      }
